==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|en|befo|befo'||AAVE|pronunciation spelling}}
* {{alt|en|b4|be4||Internet slang}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|en|enm|before//bifore}}, from {{inh|en|ang|beforan}}, from {{m|ang|be-}} + {{m|ang|foran||before}}, from {{m|ang|fore}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*furai}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*per-||front}}. Cognate with {{cog|stq|befoar|t=before}}, {{cog|nds-de|bevör|t=before}}, {{cog|de|bevor|t=before}}.

